      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im feeling really weird right now. my hands are shaking uncontrollably and i'm sweating a lot. i think my sugar is low but i'm also kinda confused and dizzy. i have my insulin right here... should i take a small dose of my long acting stuff now just so it stays stable and i dont crash even harder later? i'm by myself and kinda scared",
